-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><span style=\"padding-left: 3px; padding-right: 3px; color: white; background-color: #D50000\" title=\"This element has obligations\">O</span></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">0..*</td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSHealthProfessional.html\">EHDSHealthProfessional</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">Actors who performed the procedure (only main responsible actors expected).<br/><table class=\"obligation grid\"><tr><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>Obligations</b></td><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>Actor</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>SHOULD</b>:<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/extensions/5.3.0/CodeSystem-obligation.html#obligation-process\" title=\"Obligation Codes: process\">process</a></td><td style=\"font-size: 11px; opacity: 0.5;\"><a href=\"ActorDefinition-actor-full.html\">Full</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-size: 11px\"><b>SHOULD</b>:<a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/extensions/5.3.0/CodeSystem-obligation.html#obligation-process\" title=\"Obligation Codes: process\">process</a></td><td style=\"font-size: 11px; opacity: 0.5;\"><a href=\"ActorDefinition-actor-basic.html\">Basic</a></td></tr></table></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr style=\"border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px; vertical-align: top; background-color: #F7F7F7\"><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; white-space: nowrap; background